    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25563" root="ضجع" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضُجْعَةٌ</span></b>  <i>One whom people often lay upon his
side</i> [or <i>throw down</i>]. (K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [And app., <i>One
who lays others on the side,</i> or <i>prostrates them;</i>
as is implied by what here follows.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  (assumed tropical:)  <i>A
disease:</i> (K, TA:) because it lays the man upon
his bed. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَجْعَةٌ</span>, in two places.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  And see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضُجَعَةٌ</span>.

